    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.4",
      "title": "Gorget",
      "body": "Barbutes are not designed to be worn with an aventail, unlike bascinets. Barbutes are worn with a gorget.\n\nBarbutes must be worn with a plate gorget, or a safe construction simulating a mail gorget as best as possible.\n\nGorget must be constructed in such a way as to protect its wearer. Mail gorget must integrate a grill of protection or additional plates.\n\nChainmail gorget must conform to Chainmail Aventails requirements listed in the “Aventails” document.\nAdditional neck protection can be worn according to historical sources.\nAdditional neck protection not based on historical sources can be worn if concealed.",
      "page_from": 7,
      "page_to": 7,
      "stable_key": "barbutes:4.4",
      "parent_key": "barbutes:4",
