    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.5",
      "title": "Others",
      "body": "Barbutes may be decorated in the spirit of medieval styles, such as orle, torse, decorated collar, coat of arms badges etc.\n\nSuch decoration must be made in coherence with historical sources.\n\nBarbutes can be covered with silk or velvet, as per historical sources. These decorations require a lot of maintenance to maintain a high level of aesthetic. Any Barbute with silk or velvet cover that is too much damaged can be denied during Authenticity Check.\n\nUsing modern and/or offensive imagery and slogans is prohibited.",
